                        <span class="chip chip--accent">available</span>
                    </header>
                    <ul>
                        <li>One command line for every operation.</li>
                        <li>Studio shell that stays empty until a host connects.</li>
                        <li>Capability matrix shared by both surfaces.</li>
                        <li>Stable error codes for every rejection.</li>
                        <li>Agent skill that documents the same limits.</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
