                    <span class="step__index">01</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="step__top">
                            <h3>Open</h3>
                            <span class="chip chip--accent">available</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Detect the container and architecture, then read the entry point, image base and hash.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="step">
                    <span class="step__index">02</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="step__top">
                            <h3>Map</h3>
                            <span class="chip chip--accent">available</span>
